      "created_at": "2016-03-01T03:09:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I saw in another post that there's a way to get a log of your game to see what happened during it. How does one do that? I'm reasonably certain I should have unlocked Freedom Six AZ in my last game but it didn't happen.</p>",
