      "id": 163900,
      "name": "jorgenp",
      "username": "jorgenp",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/958977/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-03-01T03:16:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Provided you're on Steam (as you can't access the files on iOS, etc., I'm guessing), check the following location (subbing in your username):</p><p>C:\\Users\\&lt;username&gt;\\AppData\\LocalLow\\Handelabra Games Inc_\\Sentinels</p><p>There should be a log.txt, which is your most recent game, and usually a log-copy.txt, which will be the one before the most recent.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:45:00.071Z",
