      "created_at": "2016-03-01T04:02:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, Cryo Chamber is one of them.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The four Equipment cards are:</p><ul>\n<li>Cryo Chamber</li>\n<li>Focused Apertures</li>\n<li>Isothermic Transducers</li>\n<li>Null-Point Calibration Unit</li>\n</ul><p>You can check them out in The Multiverse section of the game to confirm that :).</p>",
